    <string name="faqfullForm">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</string>
    <string name="question_first">1. What is the AMS QR App used for?</string>
    <string name="question_second">2. How do I mark my attendance using the app?</string>
    <string name="question_third">3. Do I need to be at the company location to mark attendance?</string>
    <string name="question_four">4. Why does the app need location (GPS) access?</string>
    <string name="question_five">5. What should I do if the QR code is not scanning?</string>
    <string name="answer_first">The AMS QR App is an attendance management system that allows employees to mark their attendance by scanning a QR code placed at the company\'s authorized location.</string>
    <string name="answer_second">To mark your attendance:\n1. Open the AMS QR App.\n2. Tap on the "Scan QR" option.\n3. Scan the QR code available at your company\'s entrance or reception.\n4. If your location is verified, your attendance will be marked successfully.</string>
    <string name="answer_third">Yes. You must be physically present at the company\'s authorized location. The app checks your GPS location and matches it with the company location before allowing attendance.</string>
    <string name="answer_four">GPS is required to verify that you are within the company\'s geofenced area. Without location access, you won\'t be able to mark your attendance.</string>
    <string name="answer_five">Make sure:\n1. Your camera is working properly.\n2. The QR code is not damaged or blurry.\n3. You are connected to the internet and location is turned ON.\n4. If the issue continues, contact your admin or HR department.</string>
